# ── Secrets and credentials (NEVER commit these) ──────────────────
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.key
serviceAccount*.json
firebase-adminsdk-*.json
# Broader than the line above on purpose: a real key file was found named
# "sparkdate-philly-firebase-adminsdk-fbsvc-....json" -- Firebase's own
# console names downloaded keys "<project>-firebase-adminsdk-....json", so
# the marker can land anywhere in the filename, not just as a prefix.
*firebase-adminsdk*.json
sparkdate_strike_keys.txt
sparkdate_firebase_config.txt
*service-account*

